      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have one of the world as favorite, but it seems not more  available. But i can also not remove it. It just stay there.\n\nYou can also add option 'clean up favorites' so server can check if the worlds are available or not, and will auto delete it if it's already removed.\n\nCan also done automatic by login, so you get message 'World XXX is not more available' so you know the world is gone, and removed from Favorites.\n\nShould same for Friends, if friends has deleted account, it should show 'Friend XXXX is not more in game' and if a player unfriend you, you get message too after login game.\n\nMakes more clear what happened when you're not in the game.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
